{"author": "pgaudet", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0004033 aldo-keto reductase (NADPH) activity & replace by 'GO:0008106  alcohol dehydrogenase (NADP+) activity'\n\nSee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/28532#issuecomment-2729168038\n\nGroup | Number of manual annotations\n-- | --\nCGD | 1\nEcoCyc | 2\nEcoliWiki | 1\nMGI | 2\nReactome | 17\nRGD | 5\nSGD | 4\nTAIR | 1\nUniProt | 14\nZFIN | 2\n\nAnnotations are here: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1zqLsRBsIlBSg96rW0yaldaJqxavaj5VeasN3Mpau6Es/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\nIf your group has automatic annotation replacement, no action is needed. \n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2025-03-17T11:41:01Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to GO:0004033 aldo-keto reductase (NADPH) activity", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-03-25T06:34:48Z"}
